guide forever/class/hunter/taming-the-beast-alliance
title Taming the Beast (Alliance)
category Class
class Hunter
folder Hunter
faction Alliance
race Human, Dwarf, NightElf, Skyborne
levels 10-10
zone Elwynn Forest
keywords Taming the Beast, Training the Beast, The Hunter's Path, Taming Rod, Tame Beast, Beast Training, pet, Josephine Carson, Isaac Chan, Grif Wildheart, Belia Thundergranite, Dazalar, Jocaste, Quel'ana Quickgale, Quel'dora Quickgale, Goldshire, Kharanos, Dolanaar, Valanaar, pet trainer, Hunter
